                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "# Loaded Skill: lore-self-career-index (skill)\n\nKai's professional position and how the market reads it, ten entries from role direction and positioning to interview execution and the 2026 technical-screen market. Each body is a file in references/. Triggers - start a business, founding, startup idea, bootstrap, venture, productized service, is this a business, career, job search, role fit, direction, employment type, consulting, contracting, flagship, JD, recruiter, positioning, market read, interview format, tenure, comp band, office days, offer statement, what do you do, sales conversation, buyer framing, umbra pitch, mcp-beaver pitch, agent-compose pitch, sirens-echo pitch, rate conversation, client call, federal contract, defense client, procurement review, covered AI, NDAA, DeepSeek, interview outcome, recruiter screen, proof package, buyers, credential, leaving a job, employer code, archive my work, keep this knowledge, offboarding, clean room, AI ethics, artist harm, training data, advertising, is this ethical, politics of tech, interview prep, live coding, technical screen, take-home, accommodation, interview practice, practice session, skills library, LeetCode, daily practice, deliberate practice, rule library, drills, should I practice, third day, streak, async proctoring, AI proctoring, ADA accommodation, disability disclosure, hiring page, is the market closing, autism hiring, neurodiversity program.\n\n## Content\n\n# self-career index\n\n10 entries. Each one is a file under `references/`, read the one you need\nrather than the whole directory.\n\n* [`business-disposition.md`](references/business-disposition.md) - Kai's\n  founding impulse, the transition-state founding motive, and the product-type-\n  before-financing rule.\n* [`career-direction.md`](references/career-direction.md) - Kai's durable\n  professional direction, why the role transition is running, and which\n  employment shapes are reachable.\n* [`career-positioning.md`](references/career-positioning.md) - Kai's\n  professional identity, market signal, role filters, interview-format fit, and\n  tenure framing.\n* [`contracting-offers.md`](references/contracting-offers.md) - Speaking\n  palette for Kai's contracting conversations - the buyer-side framing of each\n  headline project, five cells each, plus which cells convert.\n* [`credential-legibility.md`](references/credential-legibility.md) - The at-a-\n  glance credential gap, the technical-buyer audience mismatch, and how agents\n  read a poor interview outcome.\n* [`employer-code-retention.md`](references/employer-code-retention.md) -\n  Clean-room career-capital boundary for employer work. What Kai keeps when\n  leaving a role and what she never retains.\n* [`heterodox-tech-industry-defense.md`](references/heterodox-tech-industry-\n  defense.md) - Kai's material-safety, consent, labor-impact, and end-use frame\n  for positions that read as heterodox in left-of-tech circles.\n* [`interview-execution.md`](references/interview-execution.md) - How Kai\n  performs in an interview room, as distinct from how the market reads her. The\n  years-long live-coding problem, its mechanism, and why it is an accommodation\n  question rather than a practice one.\n* [`skills-practice.md`](references/skills-practice.md) - Kai's representation-\n  and-harness practice program, the LeetCode corpus used without solving\n  anything, the cadence that survives her collapse window, and the hard rule\n  that it is not interview preparation.\n* [`technical-screen-market.md`](references/technical-screen-market.md) - What\n  the 2026 technical-screen market is doing to Kai's reachable roles, why the\n  accommodation route has almost no remedy behind it, and why publishing her\n  requirements is the instrument that works instead.\n\n## Supporting Files\n\nSkill directory: /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index\n\nRelative paths in this skill resolve from the skill directory. The shell tool runs in the session working directory, so use the resolved path below or `cd` into the skill directory before running supporting scripts.\n\n- references/career-positioning.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index/references/career-positioning.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-career-index/references/career-positioning.md\"))\n- references/contracting-offers.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index/references/contracting-offers.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-career-index/references/contracting-offers.md\"))\n- references/heterodox-tech-industry-defense.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index/references/heterodox-tech-industry-defense.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-career-index/references/heterodox-tech-industry-defense.md\"))\n- references/credential-legibility.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index/references/credential-legibility.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-career-index/references/credential-legibility.md\"))\n- references/business-disposition.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index/references/business-disposition.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-career-index/references/business-disposition.md\"))\n- references/career-direction.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index/references/career-direction.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-career-index/references/career-direction.md\"))\n- references/interview-execution.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index/references/interview-execution.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-career-index/references/interview-execution.md\"))\n- references/employer-code-retention.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index/references/employer-code-retention.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-career-index/references/employer-code-retention.md\"))\n- references/skills-practice.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index/references/skills-practice.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-career-index/references/skills-practice.md\"))\n- references/technical-screen-market.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-new-2/.agents/skills/lore-self-career-index/references/technical-screen-market.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-self-career-index/references/technical-screen-market.md\"))\n"
